                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Does not control at all like a helicopter.  You can even remap up/down mouse so you aren't nosediving when you mean to climb.  Tanks fly up and flip over when blown up.  Don't get me wrong, I love arcade-y helicopter games (Desert Strike, anyone?) but this is definitely on one of them.  Bought it for $0.49 and I regret it.  Why are all these 'Publisher' games on Steam while good games by indies sit in Greenlight?",
